#. module: pos_compago
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_compago.field_pos_payment_method__compago_environment
msgid ""
"Select the environment that the Point of Sale will connect to::\n"
"\n"
"- Production: The environment for processing real payments with active "
"terminals.\n"
"\n"
"- Demo: The environment for running tests or simulations; you will not "
"receive real charges in your bank account.\n"
"\n"
"- Local: The environment for local development without any connection to "
"Compago’s servers."
msgstr ""
"Selecciona el entorno al que se conectará el Punto de Venta:\n"
"\n"
"- Producción: El ambiente para procesar pagos reales con terminales "
"activas.\n"
"\n"
"- Demo: El ambiente para realizar pruebas o simulacros, no recibirás "
"cobros reales en tu cuenta bancaria.\n"
"\n"
"- Local: El ambiente para desarrollo local sin conexión con los "
"servidores de Compago."

